## Draft cleanup — post-loop polish passes

These run AFTER the agent's terminal `reply`, so a shipped draft can differ from the one the timeline ends on.

| # | pass | status | changed | detail |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| C1 | em_dash | rewritten | yes | markdown 44 → 41 chars · html changed · trigger em_dash · 2 flagged |
| C2 | deferral | invalid_output | no | refused, draft kept as-is: `- I'll check and come back to you. + (dropped the whole answer body)` |

```sh
jq -r 'select(.disp=="C1").args.before' 11111111-coca-cola.jsonl   # the draft as the agent wrote it
jq -r 'select(.disp=="C1").args.after'  11111111-coca-cola.jsonl   # the draft as it shipped
jq -r 'select(.args.rejected_diff).args.rejected_diff' 11111111-coca-cola.jsonl   # a rewrite the pass refused
```


